<title>USA: Cygne Designs Inc cuts Q2 Aug 3 loss.</title>
<headline>Cygne Designs Inc cuts Q2 Aug 3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.01     loss	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net loss			88     loss	 5,055</p>
<p> Revs			75,886		  132,067</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,438		   12,438</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Company sold GJM business in February 1996.  </p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		     NIL     loss	 $0.77</p>
<p> Net loss			57     loss	 9,735</p>
<p> Revs		     159,642		  260,434</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,438		   12,662</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended Aug 3 vs July 29.</p>
<p>Company sold GJM business in February 1996. 1995 six month period includes a gain of $4.7 million from the sale of subsidiary. 1996 pro-forma loss per share $0.15 in Q2 and $0.29 in six month period, giving effect to sale of GJM business as if it had been completed before the start of the period.</p>
